Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这句话很难说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, it's a really hard word to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪位  瑞秋在吗  我是她的妹妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes? Hi. ls Rachel here? I'm her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  吉儿  天哪  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Jill. Oh, my God, Rachel.
